# Markdown is owned by mdformat (see the mdformat job in lint.yml), not prettier.
# Keep prettier off all markdown so the two formatters never fight over it.
#
# This file is copied from the consumer repos. lint.yml's own prettier job
# carries the comment "Markdown is excluded from prettier via .prettierignore --
# mdformat owns it", i.e. the reusable states a requirement about its CALLER --
# and until this commit the library that ships that job was the one caller in
# the org that did not satisfy it. Nothing could notice, because this repo had
# no CI at all.
*.md
**/*.md
